{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Allumeria</strong> is a voxel sandbox game. Explore, fight and build to shape the land to your will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer <strong>bosses</strong> and collect valuable <strong>loot</strong> to improve your character. <strong>Explore</strong> winding cave systems with <strong>secrets</strong> and <strong>structures</strong> to discover. <strong>Build</strong> a base to <strong>defend</strong> yourself at night. <strong>Allumeria</strong> strives to harness the <strong>full potential</strong> of what a voxel sandbox game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/784667e40f4238e10f65393c16f09896.poster.avif?t=1771869391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/784667e40f4238e10f65393c16f09896.webm?t=1771869391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/784667e40f4238e10f65393c16f09896.mp4?t=1771869391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allumeria provides <strong>advanced building tools</strong> not present in other games. You can <strong>change the shape</strong> of any block on the fly. Want glass stairs? Want a dirt fence? You can do it! Allumeria has a <strong>full RGB light engine</strong>. Create dimly lit cozy cabins, or bright neon cities. Monsters only spawn on natural blocks, so you are free to experiment with dark and light! The Paint Roller allows you to <strong>paint ANY block</strong> in the game, with no limitations. Want to use bricks, but grey isn't your style? Just paint them blue! Multiple palettes are available, from colourful, to earthy, to pastel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/f4026fdf7b619f61a15292d31dd776f1.avif?t=1771869391\" width=768 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allumeria is a <strong>procedurally generated</strong> world, packed full of content. Each biome has <strong>unique gameplay, environments, items, weapons, enemies</strong> and <strong>loot</strong>. The game generates procedural <strong>dungeons</strong> and <strong>structures</strong>, filled with <strong>traps</strong> and <strong>treasure</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/223032e1032b5c44648a37590d99deb2.avif?t=1771869391\" width=768 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine</strong> in a vast <strong>interconnected</strong> cave network filled with <strong>shiny ores</strong> and <strong>perilous danger</strong>. Caves are <strong>bountiful and frequent</strong>, meaning you will <strong>not</strong> have to strip mine for resources. They are filled with more than just ore, unique <strong>biomes, plant life, enemies </strong>and <strong>structures</strong> await you in the depths...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comming Soon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allumeria is currently in development and will be coming soon. If you are interested in the game, consider <strong>adding it to your wishlist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516590?t=1771869391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/b08a62cb321d761812751f8cbfe227a24114a6a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771869391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/54bbdedacde87142816d3a2b1ba7b5c6ef7bb9ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771869391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/54bbdedacde87142816d3a2b1ba7b5c6ef7bb9ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771869391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4247370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Allumeria</strong> is a voxel sandbox game. Explore, fight and build to shape the land to your will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer <strong>bosses</strong> and collect valuable <strong>loot</strong> to improve your character. <strong>Explore</strong> winding cave systems with <strong>secrets</strong> and <strong>structures</strong> to discover. <strong>Build</strong> a base to <strong>defend</strong> yourself at night. <strong>Allumeria</strong> strives to harness the <strong>full potential</strong> of what a voxel sandbox game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/784667e40f4238e10f65393c16f09896.poster.avif?t=1771869391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/784667e40f4238e10f65393c16f09896.webm?t=1771869391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/784667e40f4238e10f65393c16f09896.mp4?t=1771869391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allumeria provides <strong>advanced building tools</strong> not present in other games. You can <strong>change the shape</strong> of any block on the fly. Want glass stairs? Want a dirt fence? You can do it! Allumeria has a <strong>full RGB light engine</strong>. Create dimly lit cozy cabins, or bright neon cities. Monsters only spawn on natural blocks, so you are free to experiment with dark and light! The Paint Roller allows you to <strong>paint ANY block</strong> in the game, with no limitations. Want to use bricks, but grey isn't your style? Just paint them blue! Multiple palettes are available, from colourful, to earthy, to pastel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/f4026fdf7b619f61a15292d31dd776f1.avif?t=1771869391\" width=768 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allumeria is a <strong>procedurally generated</strong> world, packed full of content. Each biome has <strong>unique gameplay, environments, items, weapons, enemies</strong> and <strong>loot</strong>. The game generates procedural <strong>dungeons</strong> and <strong>structures</strong>, filled with <strong>traps</strong> and <strong>treasure</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/extras/223032e1032b5c44648a37590d99deb2.avif?t=1771869391\" width=768 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine</strong> in a vast <strong>interconnected</strong> cave network filled with <strong>shiny ores</strong> and <strong>perilous danger</strong>. Caves are <strong>bountiful and frequent</strong>, meaning you will <strong>not</strong> have to strip mine for resources. They are filled with more than just ore, unique <strong>biomes, plant life, enemies </strong>and <strong>structures</strong> await you in the depths...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comming Soon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allumeria is currently in development and will be coming soon. If you are interested in the game, consider <strong>adding it to your wishlist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Unomelon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/e4aa377597c2aed7ce1e2b33f464600f76bcfc73/header.jpg?t=1771869391","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516590/1506878485/0f7c1a4517f2635c93ba528f2ed0aade36448bff/1767516312/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771869390","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516590/1506878485/0f7c1a4517f2635c93ba528f2ed0aade36448bff/1767516312/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771869390","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516590/1506878485/0f7c1a4517f2635c93ba528f2ed0aade36448bff/1767516312/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771869390","id":257259073,"name":"Demo Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257259073/110b109b8656730d5082ca6ee0d9eb824854fe3e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771869390"}],"name":"Allumeria","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8th Gen Intel i3 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1080 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 10th Gen Intel i5 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1650 or Equivalent</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Unomelon"],"rat