391"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/3aeb563cce8a21dbaa98746cbb907b8b80fbd566/ss_3aeb563cce8a21dbaa98746cbb907b8b80fbd566.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771869391","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/3aeb563cce8a21dbaa98746cbb907b8b80fbd566/ss_3aeb563cce8a21dbaa98746cbb907b8b80fbd566.600x338.jpg?t=1771869391"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/7fe1756fb2d8c3df32ea393e7bf5cc402b03f31e/ss_7fe1756fb2d8c3df32ea393e7bf5cc402b03f31e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771869391","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/7fe1756fb2d8c3df32ea393e7bf5cc402b03f31e/ss_7fe1756fb2d8c3df32ea393e7bf5cc402b03f31e.600x338.jpg?t=1771869391"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/391787a3007c71f163c8eb1abc3baf9fb6ee6f13/ss_391787a3007c71f163c8eb1abc3baf9fb6ee6f13.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771869391","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516590/391787a3007c71f163c8eb1abc3baf9fb6ee6f13/ss_391787a3007c71f163c8eb1abc3baf9fb6ee6f13.600x338.jpg?t=1771869391"}],"short_description":"Explore a vast and hazardous cave network and uncover mountains of loot. Build a town and trade with NPCs using advanced building and lighting tools. Fight bosses and raid dungeons to unlock abilities. Play with your friends, and build, fight, thrive, in the fully destructible world of Allumeria!","steam_appid":3516590,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://unomelon.neocities.org/support"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}